      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GAMETIME (9) is in good form with top-five finishes at his last four starts, most recently recording a third over 2100m at this track. Needs to be at his best to beat this field but he is up to the challenge. APOLOGIZE (8) finished third at Narrogin two starts back then did a great job again at his latest appearance over 2190m at at Northam, beaten 10 metres into third after being handy in the run. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Meets a similar line up and he is a strong winning hope. ITSOKTOBEGREY (10) is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win by 2.75 metres at Gloucester Park over 2130m. OAKLEY NZ (4) is in the mix following a respectable third at his most recent appearance over 1177m at Pinjarra.",
